Why don't you start trying it tomorrow?

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:59.032
People with healthy kidney function

00:09:59.032 --> 00:10:00.867
Protect your kidneys with these two methods

00:10:00.867 --> 00:10:03.036
First, keep the sauces separate.

00:10:03.036 --> 00:10:05.505
Second, use natural ingredients as spices.

00:10:05.505 --> 00:10:06.706
When you order

00:10:06.706 --> 00:10:07.507
tell the staff

00:10:07.507 --> 00:10:08.575
to use less sauce

00:10:08.575 --> 00:10:10.410
Or the sauces can be kept separate

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.612
This way you can decide for yourself

00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:14.848
How much should I dip

00:10:14.848 --> 00:10:16.749
2. Use natural ingredients as spices

00:10:16.749 --> 00:10:18.017
People who enjoy cooking

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:19.953
suggest you use less chicken bouillon cubes.

00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:21.554
Use natural ingredients

00:10:21.554 --> 00:10:23.289
Onions, garlic, and shiitake mushrooms

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:24.224
When the soup base

00:10:24.224 --> 00:10:25.091
You can use it for stir-frying

00:10:25.091 --> 00:10:27.794
Basil, ginger, scallions, garlic, pepper

00:10:27.794 --> 00:10:29.696
To replace chemical seasonings

00:10:29.696 --> 00:10:31.731
This way, your kidneys are well-maintained.

00:10:31.731 --> 00:10:34.167
It makes feel more comfortable when eat it.

00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:35.702
How should kidney patients eat?

00:10:35.702 --> 00:10:38.671
Eat 3 fruits and 5 vegetables with peace of mind

00:10:38.671 --> 00:10:40.640
Kidney patients are most concerned about

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.076
what they can and cannot eat

00:10:43.076 --> 00:10:46.012
Theories from ancient Chinese medicine texts on abstaining from salt and soy sauce

00:10:46.012 --> 00:10:47.514
We can extend this to mean

00:10:47.514 --> 00:10:49.249
that kidney patients should avoid eating foods

00:10:49.249 --> 00:10:53.453
that are too strong in flavor, too salty, too spicy, too sour, or too sweet

00:10:53.453 --> 00:10:54.387
So-called

00:10:54.387 --> 00:10:55.889
rich and flavorful foods

00:10:55.889 --> 00:10:57.290
These foods can easily increase

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:58.858
the burden on the kidneys

00:10:58.858 --> 00:11:01.728
It makes kidney function deteriorate faster.

00:11:01.728 --> 00:11:02.762
There are 3 kinds of food

00:11:02.762 --> 00:11:04.931
It is recommended that kidney patients eat less or avoid it altogether.

00:11:04.931 --> 00:11:09.269
1. Processed meat products: meat floss, sausage, bacon

00:11:09.269 --> 00:11:14.440
2. Processed foods: instant noodles, potato chips, candied fruit

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:18.344
3. Pickled foods: kimchi, pickled cucumbers, pickled mustard greens

00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:19.546
What are the dietary restrictions

00:11:19.546 --> 00:11:21.414
for fruits and vegetables for kidney patients?

00:11:21.414 --> 00:11:23.416
What vegetables can kidney patients eat?

00:11:23.416 --> 00:11:27.487
Cabbage, cauliflower, bean sprouts, loofah, water bamboo

00:11:27.487 --> 00:11:29.656
What fruits can kidney patients eat?

00:11:29.656 --> 00:11:32.292
Guava, apple, and blueberry

00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:34.761
Vegetables that kidney patients need to limit are

00:11:34.761 --> 00:11:37.597
Spinach, sweet potato leaves, potatoes, tomatoes

00:11:37.597 --> 00:11:39.098
They are all due to high potassium levels.

00:11:39.098 --> 00:11:41.167
Eat less or blanch.

00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:43.770
Remove the potassium before eating.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:46.239
Fruits that need to be restricted: Kiwi, Banana

00:11:46.239 --> 00:11:49.475
Star fruit that should absolutely not be eaten

00:11:49.475 --> 00:11:51.377
The safest approach is

00:11:51.377 --> 00:11:52.812
to adjust the diet of kidney patients according

00:11:52.812 --> 00:11:55.014
to their individual conditions

00:11:55.014 --> 00:11:55.982
I suggest you

00:11:55.982 --> 00:11:57.517
for an evaluation

00:11:57.517 --> 00:11:59.452
to avoid making mistakes

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:02.088
and to protect your kidneys

